	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Cherry MX style, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R2.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square with R2.00 corner relief (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square with R2.00 corner relief (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: ISO Enter flipped upside down (courtyard only; switch orientation unchanged). Cherry MX PCB-mount stabilizer holes included (vertical 2u, wire side at x=-8.255). Stabilizer plate cut on User.5 (fits plate-mount and PCB-mount MX stabilizers).")
